      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Garrison%2C_New_York",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Boscobel, a Federal‑style mansion moved from Montrose in the 1940s, now houses the Russel Wright Design Center and offers tours of its gardens.",
